menu "Game controller application"

config KWS_ONLY
	bool "Run KWS only (skip the gesture engine)"
	default n
	help
	  Leave the gesture engine out of the build, so the app never touches
	  the BMI270 IMU. No longer needed just to boot without the IMU: an
	  engine whose init() fails is marked unavailable and skipped, so the
	  KWS engines come up regardless of whether the IMU is jumper-wired in.
	  Enable it only to skip the IMU bring-up entirely -- with it set, btn1
	  (snake driven by swipe gestures) has no engine to select and does
	  nothing.

config KWS_EMA_ALPHA
	int "Exponential moving average coefficient for class probability"
	range 0 1000
	default 120
	help
	  Coefficient for new entries in exponential moving average calculation for average class
	  probability. The value is expressed in units of 1/1000.

endmenu

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
